Cell["\<\
jose 2018-01-15: The multiplication table we currently give is based on the \
order given by a permutation representation of the group, while the list of \
matrices has been given is some other order. I need to find the reordering \
that moves one to the other, but this is not simple, so I'd prefer not to do \
it right now.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"eeede0b6-c550-47a5-8c93-18d7a1ad5892"]
}, Closed]],

